WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.150
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:06.313
First: Contoso H R analysts
contains Contoso H R leads.

3
00:00:06.313 --> 00:00:08.874
Why does the map flag it nested, flatten?

4
00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:10.275
The answer is a.

5
00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:14.675
A dynamic rule can't select groups, so
the inner group's members would drop out.

6
00:00:14.675 --> 00:00:20.050
Second: Contoso payroll users reaches
two databases on sequel P R D oh one.

7
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.463
Which check catches the
one-group-one-role problem?

8
00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:27.462
The answer is b: Chapter 4's login
plan, whose warning names the roles.

9
00:00:27.462 --> 00:00:31.125
The map carries grants per
instance, not roles per database.

10
00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:35.470
The module page has two more questions,
each linked to the section that answers it.
